{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "fd36c737e068c5824e25c8e03bc0df60ea3018ab4631d24478d5bfcba707f2db", "ja": "音無先輩にも負けないくらい、立派な事務員に\nなるためにも……お仕事のやり方を見直さなくちゃ。", "zh": "为了成为不输给音无前辈的出色事务员……我得重新审视一下工作的方式才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "3cee3fe45d068ad5ce3fbcba713069a4c5169f3bda79af1bcd3806c1926368c1", "ja": "データの整理、スケジュール記入、\n来客の案内、チケットのもぎり、あとは……。", "zh": "整理数据、填写日程、接待来客、检票，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fcae2c2c0c160c85df6dec0252ce009f82aaa8dd0a4ead6d4ca7994ce3e6f0a1", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6f663b4047097e8a81da08ff12f5ee9f548e5e8c345d0805200d2d5347a63fe2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nちょうどいいところに……今、お茶を淹れますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n您来得正好……我这就去泡茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d8fcf993695f871e6238388de546f50e67811d603b4e8bb880a628375a0a174b", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nでも、すぐに事務所に向かう予定なので。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n不过，我正打算马上去事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "fa98daedcc6ebd3685242aee6400298c239d6c5cdb410674908c78344ca1fc27", "ja": "あっ、そうでしたか！\n鍛え直したかったのに……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样！\n本来还想重新锻炼一下的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "78f97edd5bcf37ded6f2834c1f8ee5fcd0407351df4c646e55e4f5d06923fa7c", "ja": "鍛え直す……？\nあの、ところで聞きたいことがあるんですが。", "zh": "重新锻炼……？那个，顺便有件事我想问一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "348746dfa86a25f6a89b06f9cf12eab7b8ba0e94a77dfa998d1250644e9cd110", "ja": "控え室のカーテンが、きれいに繕ってあって……\n青羽さんが直してくれたんですよね？", "zh": "休息室的窗帘被仔细地缝补好了……\n是青羽小姐帮忙修好的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "def9fc8ab52ca2862aaa0c8dfaab5978325b36b1a297accb789c393f5017bf11", "ja": "あ、はい！　私です。ほつれがあるのに\n気が付いたので、隙間時間に……。", "zh": "啊，是的！是我补好的。因为发现有地方脱线了，就利用空闲时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b0f81274feb3fa085df012a52865d9c25bc55377c5109b1658c257e1c13d6ef6", "ja": "こぶんが、爪を引っ掛けてしまったんだそうです。\n環が気にして、謝りに来たので……。", "zh": "听说是小弟把指甲勾住了。环很在意，还特地过来道歉，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "38a12202e204cb71ecf97c822391bdd4c036bb362010d56c14d0d6bc2f5b86f8", "ja": "後でお願いしようと思ってたのに、気が付いて\nもらってすみません。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "本来打算待会儿再去拜托你的，没想到倒让你\n先发现了，不好意思啊。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "b053891d087d53655c666ae8a88ea978c8d4c05b8ef98dc32197acb0ac9080ac", "ja": "いえ、そんな！　本当にたいしたことじゃないので。\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "不，没那回事！真的不是什么大不了的事。\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "659dbc287a974659dd99136d5b0f2143b989f4b192b4ae4fe8b35a3c8787f0ae", "ja": "それだけ、伝えておこうと思って。\nそれじゃあ、事務所に行ってきます！", "zh": "我就想把这些告诉你。那我去办公室了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "004b34f31abdd578f9b01312e0027d5b88a2fc50eb76eb4629dc88211064d591", "ja": "はい！　いってらっしゃーい！\n……そっかぁ……。", "zh": "好的！路上小心——！\n……这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "bb12205e85b589481559b95a345bfda302a1d1822dfe5bdbbdbfb380470302ae", "ja": "私は私なりに、事務員やれてるのかも……？\nよーし、今日も一日頑張ろうっと♪", "zh": "我也许已经以自己的方式做好事务员了吧……？\n好，今天也要加油♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "71e04cdc0d9870a60fa1a735e46b7bf3e7065acc545954eafd57c10d41a8aab0", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれたね！\nまずはかけたまえ。", "zh": "嗨，你来得正好！先请坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "d8cdb6f034d94f581d15a023810a0a1b3ffd1fbce331f09ee9fa8fddeec8e023", "ja": "すぐお茶を淹れますね。社長のお友達から、\nいい茶葉をいただいたんです。", "zh": "我这就泡茶。社长的朋友送了我上好的茶叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "54a7f30464209f6fd1f6818b3a2a77eb4ca7563726bebc60f4ee03726b8f4e15", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……ふう、音無さんの\n淹れてくれるお茶はやっぱりおいしいですね。", "zh": "谢谢您……呼，音无小姐泡的茶果然好喝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "2ea976fd0f79587d8ac5f9a28b4a89d70a4ecebd9fbaf1fe2f0d965e665f1002", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます。うふふ♪", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢您的夸奖。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5881cd84473b24cd6d7afe391e1674a42552522c5490ef6b15c768e739d34cde", "ja": "それで社長、お話というのは……。", "zh": "那么，社长，您说有事要谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "bcadda1a1a227108a707198bec238e9dbbfc32c11892a3b2b499f999bc698513", "ja": "うむ！　『BATTLE OF THEATER』開催宣言公演が\n終わり、いよいよ第一回対決を迎えることになる。", "zh": "嗯！『BATTLE OF THEATER』的开幕宣言公演\n结束后，终于要迎来第一场对决了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "0707f305c7cf8af31811144a45684df28f2e43f94641e5ba43694ea95bed0c37", "ja": "この3グループを更に2つに分けて、\n計6チームで競い合う企画ですね！", "zh": "这是把这3个团体进一步分成2组，以总计6支队伍展开竞争的企划，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "74d954f388e27faacd36ef4869d3c634ae49764971d662897b8f37f5d404be77", "ja": "今回はPrincess [girly]から奈緒、\nFairy [mystical]から瑞希。", "zh": "这次是Princess [girly]的奈绪，以及Fairy [mystical]的瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0345ce882daf8e648a7934c645ba9cecf79113d6e19c239a22a198ecd8ef4505", "ja": "Princess [pretty]から雪歩、\nFairy [breaker]から昴の4人ですね。", "zh": "Princess [pretty]的雪步，\n以及Fairy [breaker]的昴，一共4个人对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "f61aa5566a1bb6b07e183582e639b931b5f662d493bcc49f3efa7ce4178d1aae", "ja": "4人全員別チーム……\n個人戦みたいなものですね。", "zh": "4个人全都在不同队伍……\n可以说是类似个人战了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "2cd3a33614e757ea55c7391b9383b0f8ca5cb923c95ad495315cae4fc17a42f3", "ja": "その通り！　そこで、個人戦に相応しい、\nアイドルらしい勝負を用意した。それは……！", "zh": "正是如此！　所以，我准备了一场适合个人赛的、充满偶像风格的对决。那就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5b2887851427655446ab12b5ea53d563f505029e096d0213fab5b87484302388", "ja": "そ、それは……？", "zh": "那、那是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "ffc3f9bb7e09cf6c33536188d01c7a46cb2192ca15d56c481fb08e9d728199e3", "ja": "CDの手売り勝負だ！　アイドル諸君が、\n自身の手で売ったCDの枚数で、勝敗を決する！", "zh": "这是一场CD现场手卖对决！由各位偶像\n亲手卖出的CD张数来决定胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "6287b9e9ff7a690d32bb662cde259c5714496c68e379f8dfe014e60836aeb52d", "ja": "なるほど、CDの手売り……！\n新人アイドルにとって、基本中の基本ですね……。", "zh": "原来如此，亲手销售CD……！\n对新人偶像来说，这是最基本的基本功呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "5459525f32edfc5a4780b32a3317c3a32db0fd417d1e1f604a1ea374d0edbe4b", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル諸君は、様々な活躍を\n見せてくれているが、まだまだ道のりは長い……。", "zh": "嗯！偶像诸君虽然展现出了各种各样的\n精彩表现，但前方的路还很漫长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "092b99d6ecf4ae798ad26373ff7562bad68d4508ec9d068afca919867847f6c7", "ja": "ここで、初心に返る内容もいいかと思ってね。\n新シリーズの初戦としても相応しいだろう！", "zh": "我觉得在这里安排一些回归初心的内容也不错。\n作为新系列的首战也很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "cf41ef393662e2e171ede3e7f9b841c95a8b750539e52339e7b8d7152ba1964e", "ja": "社長……さすがです！　話題性もあるし、\n新曲プロモーションの一環としても……。", "zh": "社长……果然厉害！这样既有话题性，\n作为新曲宣传的一环来说也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "b8295535663e43c9246597415ab48428b41deb66cfcfc66fa2896cef460a32ba", "ja": "ふふっ。{$P$}さんも、\nやる気に漲ってますね！", "zh": "呵呵。{$P$}先生也干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "0915aab9234d4d6b3320a76130589233f8103f341fd9ee42b173c40bbe2b7fa7", "ja": "うむ。相変わらず、頼もしい限りだ！\n今回の企画も、君に一任しよう。", "zh": "嗯。你还是一如既往地可靠啊！\n这次的企划，我也全权交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "2d9e8cd06c79ebc9e25fc7c71ba26ff32ffd8ece2e9b652d535bca7257a1b90b", "ja": "君の力で、アイドル諸君の勝負を\n熱く盛り上げてくれたまえ！", "zh": "用你的力量，让偶像们的胜负\n更加火热地高涨起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0382_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0382_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "cdea7af0310a648a3cb690c04221a882954d7010a65a2972bc52f9538bb0e10b", "ja": "はい！　CDの手売り勝負……\n全力でプロデュースします！", "zh": "好的！亲自卖CD的对决……我会全力以赴进行制作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
